GXEMUL-SEC/regress\artifacts\lcabadval\codex_scoping_20260907.txt:6700:There is also a legitimate alternative to refusing these values, but it needs honest naming. Searches for every LCA field show that `tlb_enable` and the window fields are only stored and read back; they do not implement translation. `ioc_conf` additionally affects PCI decoding through bit 0. The unguarded `W_T_BASE0` and `W_T_BASE1` already provide storage-only precedent.
GXEMUL-SEC/regress\artifacts\lcabadval\codex_fixcheck_20260907.txt:7:In `dev_lca.c`, `DEVICE_ACCESS(lca_ioc)`, each assignment is unconditional within its write branch. All six predicates match your list.
